      "entry_ids": [],
      "limitations": [
        "Akron participates in the Nov 3, 2026 coordinated election. The county's \"Precinct 2 Town of Akron\" sample ballot (style 002-02) has a Municipal Ballot Measures section with one question. Excluded as not housing: \"Town of Akron Referred Ballot Question 2B: Shall the Town of Akron's regular elections be changed to the Tuesday succeeding the first Monday of November in each even-numbered year, beginning in 2028?\"",
        "No other style has an Akron question. The town's AgendaCenter (agendas through Sep 14, 2026) shows the Aug 3, 2026 coordinated-election IGA (Resolution 26.08) and no other ballot item. The Sep 1, 2026 special-meeting agenda PDF is empty.",
        "On Aug 10, 2026 the town adopted Resolution 26.09, an expedited review process for affordable housing under Proposition 123. That is a council action, not a ballot measure.",
        "The Jul 6, 2026 packet's May minutes describe the plan to ask voters to move the town's general municipal election to November of even-numbered years, which is what 2B asks."
